OL,3,GNEWSACouncil wins legal fight over
OL,4,Aflags on lamp-posts
OL,5,
OL,6,FBirmingham City Council has won a High
OL,7,FCourt bid to prevent unauthorised flags
OL,8,Fbeing put up after a legal battle with
OL,9,Fcampaigners from an anti-migrant group.
OL,11,FThe local authority had sought an
OL,12,Finjunction against members of the group
OL,13,FRaise the Colours, who have placed
OL,14,Fthousands of St George and Union flags
OL,15,Fon lamp-posts since the summer of 2025.
OL,16,FSupporters of the group protested
OL,17,Foutside the court, wearing Raise the
OL,18,FColours shirts and hoodies.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,352,350,200,160,0,100
